#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:196
#: 4dcf94e983fb49b7922086536b346795
msgid ""
"That subtle act of clicking through a file system can prove to be "
"significant if a user needs to open more than a couple files in the same "
"directory. We can alleviate some of the work by changing the process:"
msgstr ""
"如果使用者需要在同一個目錄中開啟多個檔案，點選瀏覽檔案系統這個細微的操作可能"
"會變得顯著。我們可以透過變更流程來減輕部分工作："

#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:200
#: 591278a96c6040c99ab94cdd2d0cfedb
msgid "Remember last open folder/file system"
msgstr "記住上次開啟的資料夾/檔案系統"

#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:204
#: c30c476436eb4722b1d513e34a9e59a7
msgid "Complete task"
msgstr "完成操作"

#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:206
#: 3f9fd41cd2a24d4bb7c2427feabda6ff
msgid ""
"Clearly, cutting out something as simple as navigating through the file "
"system can save a user quite a bit of time. Alternatively, adding a button "
"or menu item like ``Open Multiple Files`` might be even better, because "
"remembering and using relevant hotkeys is often something only power users "
"know how to do!"
msgstr ""
"顯然，消除像瀏覽檔案系統這樣簡單的事情可以為使用者節省相當多的時間。或者，新"
"增像「開啟多個檔案」這樣的按鈕或選單項目可能更好，因為記住和使用相關的快速鍵"
"通常是只有進階使用者才會做的事！"

#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:211
#: abfe9a6658544b1bb3476beeed4e65cf
msgid "GNOME, KDE, and Xfce"
msgstr "GNOME、KDE 與 Xfce"

#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:213
#: 76a7377e60f2490e9a7ba674082a35e5
msgid ""
"The desktop GUIs that QubesOS versions 1 - 4.1 offer are `KDE <https://kde."
"org>`__ and `Xfce <https://xfce.org>`__. We are currently migrating towards "
"using `GNOME <https://www.gnome.org>`__. We know some people prefer KDE, but "
"we believe Gnome is easier to use for average non-technical users. Xfce will "
"always be supported, and technical users will always have the choice to use "
"KDE or other desktop environments."
msgstr ""
"QubesOS 1 至 4.1 版本提供的桌面 GUI 是 `KDE <https://kde.org>`__ 和 `Xfce "
"<https://xfce.org>`__。我們目前正在遷移到使用 `GNOME <https://www.gnome."
"org>`__。我們知道有些人偏好 KDE，但我們相信 GNOME 對一般的非技術使用者來說更"
"容易使用。Xfce 將始終受到支援，技術使用者將始終可以選擇使用 KDE 或其他桌面環"
"境。"

#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:215
#: 91efcf2d9e23464ab95bd2e567ff6856
msgid ""
"This change means you should use `GTK <https://gtk.org/>`__ rather than Qt "
"for new GUIs."
msgstr ""
"這項變更意味著您應該為新的 GUI 使用 `GTK <https://gtk.org/>`__ 而非 Qt。"

#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:217
#: b3944fd69ace4409ace7abd64de7643a
msgid ""
"All three of these mentioned desktop environments have their own `human "
"interface guidelines <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Human_interface_guidelines>`__, and we suggest you familiarize yourself with "
"the platform you developing for."
msgstr ""
"所有這三個提及的桌面環境都有各自的`人機介面指南 <https://en.wikipedia.org/"
"wiki/Human_interface_guidelines>`__，我們建議您熟悉您正在開發的平台。"

#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:219
#: d9090c0058c041d9a98715a42e7522d5
msgid "`GNOME Human Interface Guidelines <https://developer.gnome.org/hig/>`__"
msgstr "`GNOME 人機介面指南 <https://developer.gnome.org/hig/>`__"

#: ../../../developer/general/usability-ux.rst:221
#: f924ba261cd24a6c8f51dfef776e73e5
